Package: ardafetch
Type: Package
Title: Search, Download, and Load Datasets from the Association of Religion Data Archives (ARDA)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("ARDA", "User", email = "user@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools to search the ARDA catalog, download dataset files hosted on OSF
    with local caching, and load statistical files (.sav, .por, .dta, .csv, .tsv, .rds, .xlsx)
    directly into R.
